# Claude notes

- Everlast plugin: skills everlast-setup, everlast-capture, everlast-resume, everlast-vault. The vault path is printed by `everlast.py vault where`. Auto-memory holds one-line pointers; the record lives in the vault and in `ai-docs/`.
